#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10002
#: 27d310eaf25943b69c9a209dc0256038
msgid "FrequencySeriesMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "FrequencySeriesMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10004
#: 1e881ac1f76046aa8656e1d86e7870b1
msgid ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` is a 3-dimensional array container that extends "
"`SeriesMatrix` for the frequency domain (FrequencySeries) with shape: Nrow ×"
" Ncol × Nfreq."
msgstr ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` は `SeriesMatrix` を周波数領域（FrequencySeries）向けに拡張した 3 "
"次元配列コンテナです（shape: Nrow × Ncol × Nfreq）。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10006
#: 0770feb9f6364af8ad94d0a840e4d566
msgid "FrequencySeries-compatible aliases such as `df / f0 / frequencies`"
msgstr "`df / f0 / frequencies` など FrequencySeries 互換のエイリアス"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10007
#: cbf530b4d7e6424a8fd5c5d959d57f3c
msgid "Element access returns `FrequencySeries` (`fsm[i, j]`)"
msgstr "要素アクセスで `FrequencySeries` を返す（`fsm[i, j]`）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10008
#: 009ebda252e6483f8b13a89455ed5267
msgid ""
"Filter application (magnitude-only: `filter`) and complex response "
"application (`apply_response`)"
msgstr "フィルタ適用（magnitude-only: `filter`）と、複素応答の適用（`apply_response`）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10009
#: 73a6fddf5afb4876b6d29b41185aa57b
msgid "Conversion to time-domain `TimeSeriesMatrix` via `ifft()`"
msgstr "`ifft()` による時間領域 `TimeSeriesMatrix` への変換"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10010
#: c5c8b86864944c7b9e92dfac952f92ac
msgid "Direct use of display methods (`plot`, `step`, `repr`, `_repr_html_`)"
msgstr "表示系 (`plot`, `step`, `repr`, `_repr_html_`) をそのまま使用"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:10012
#: aaef29ee501d4ed5a7c540354c2c5b29
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we do not define additional utility functions; instead, we"
" directly call class methods to verify their behavior."
msgstr "このノートブックでは追加のユーティリティ関数は定義せず、クラスメソッドを直接呼び出して動作を確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:30002
#: 73af88f28c9d42108dc90066e2195f71
msgid "Prepare Representative Data"
msgstr "代表データを用意"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:30003
#: 1c640fe7d75e46948c2945a226432072
msgid ""
"We calculate `fft/asd` from `TimeSeriesMatrix` to obtain "
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix`."
msgstr "`TimeSeriesMatrix` から `fft/asd` を計算して、`FrequencySeriesMatrix` を得ます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:50002
#: 4b7146d1800a41f0ae5545f56e1bc6b8
msgid "Various Input Patterns (Constructor Examples)"
msgstr "多様な入力パターン（コンストラクタ例）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:50003
#: ada5f6f7e46640fba9cd14dcd3161b70
msgid ""
"We verify inputs via `df/f0`, `frequencies`, 2D list of `FrequencySeries`, "
"`Quantity` input, etc."
msgstr ""
"`df/f0`、`frequencies`、`FrequencySeries` の 2D リスト、`Quantity` 入力などを確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:70002
#: 6aa3ed7fb09f4c75b23393cbe0c49f9b
msgid "Indexing and Slicing"
msgstr "参照・切り出し"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:70003
#: b6962e5235fa4621861f73435a81b925
msgid "`fsm[i, j]` returns a `FrequencySeries`"
msgstr "`fsm[i, j]` は `FrequencySeries` を返す"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:70004
#: 72db32d8631c4d24aa3850ac4e9dea8f
msgid "Slicing returns a `FrequencySeriesMatrix`"
msgstr "スライスは `FrequencySeriesMatrix` を返す"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:70005
#: 515075b9838f482bbfdc1151e4970ef8
msgid "Access is also possible using row/col labels"
msgstr "row/col ラベルでもアクセスできる"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:90002
#: 94fe6d16a4be4f3487abc844109c64a7
msgid "Sample Axis Editing (frequency axis)"
msgstr "サンプル軸編集（frequency axis）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:90003
#: aeea2ae905ba4a6280ae770abbf85bc7
msgid "`diff` / `pad` return a `FrequencySeriesMatrix`"
msgstr "`diff` / `pad` は `FrequencySeriesMatrix` を返す"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:110002
#: 83f4f3e89bc248038a8494c6424204ad
msgid "Operations (operators / apply_response)"
msgstr "演算（演算子 / apply_response）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:110003
#: 02a0541d33c9462a90bc3b0f5ffb2293
msgid ""
"Arithmetic operators such as scalar multiplication preserve per-element "
"units, from either side (`2 * fsm` and `fsm * 2` behave identically)"
msgstr ""
"係数倍などの演算子では要素ごとの unit が保たれる（`2 * fsm` と `fsm * 2` は同じ結果）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:110004
#: 02a0541d33c9462a90bc3b0f5ffb2294
msgid ""
"NumPy ufuncs are **not** applied directly to a matrix: `np.sqrt(fsm)` "
"raises `TypeError`. Use `np.sqrt(fsm.value)` when a raw NumPy result is "
"wanted"
msgstr ""
"NumPy ufunc を行列に直接適用することはできない: `np.sqrt(fsm)` は `TypeError` "
"になる。生の NumPy 結果が欲しい場合は `np.sqrt(fsm.value)` を使う"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:110004
#: 56de1de1152e4122ae8550b42e36ae42
msgid ""
"`apply_response` is an extended method to apply complex/real frequency "
"responses (dimensionless)"
msgstr "`apply_response` は複素/実の周波数応答（dimensionless）を掛け合わせる拡張メソッド"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:130002
#: 5b858e918e8e48d296379ddb537fbb76
msgid "filter (magnitude-only)"
msgstr "filter（magnitude-only）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:130003
#: ad39c486bb5a456e94e5f923b6d55cc6
msgid ""
"`filter` delegates to GWpy's `fdfilter`, applying the filter's \"magnitude "
"response\" only (not the phase)."
msgstr ""
"`filter` は GWpy の `fdfilter` に委譲し、フィルタの「振幅応答（magnitude）」を適用します（位相は適用しません）。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:130005
#: f0c09b7554624370a8804f71838d6be3
msgid ""
"As an example, we apply an IIR filter created with `scipy.signal.butter` to "
"the `fft` and then convert back to the time domain with `ifft()`."
msgstr ""
"ここでは例として、`scipy.signal.butter` で作った IIR フィルタを `fft` に適用してから `ifft()` "
"で時間領域に戻します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:150002
#: 9a4620ef07cd4f40aabc08e81f92b1b2
msgid "ifft (FFT to Time Domain)"
msgstr "ifft（FFT から時間領域へ）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:150003
#: 0ff8fb4064ed45f8bd9382048c3083e1
msgid ""
"Applying `ifft()` to the output of `TimeSeriesMatrix.fft()` reproduces the "
"original `TimeSeriesMatrix` (within numerical precision)."
msgstr ""
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.fft()` の出力に対して `ifft()` を適用すると、元の `TimeSeriesMatrix` "
"が再現されます（数値誤差の範囲）。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:170002
#: 9aa5245837024f8e9f67f7c166377a11
msgid "Display Methods: repr / plot / step"
msgstr "表示系: repr / plot / step"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:170003
#: de43ca6e8ea440789a9f8ebe9bb327bd
msgid "`repr`: Text representation"
msgstr "`repr`: テキスト表示"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:170004
#: 7ff9490d13ba4e2d95a4620ad0cd458f
msgid "`_repr_html_`: In notebooks, `display(fsm)` shows tabular format"
msgstr "`_repr_html_`: ノートブックでは `display(fsm)` で表形式"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:170005
#: 75181f3945084e6e9a7fa02e4275a1cb
msgid "`plot` / `step`: Class methods for direct plotting (not saved)"
msgstr "`plot` / `step`: クラスメソッドで直接描画（保存はしない）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:190002
#: 5447e1654d72427d8bcc227717370e1c
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "まとめ"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:190003
#: c8907d96d6c649bf9c47ccd5da493da4
msgid ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` allows batch processing as a matrix while preserving"
" the frequency axis (`df/f0/frequencies`) and element metadata."
msgstr ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` "
"は周波数軸（`df/f0/frequencies`）と要素メタデータを保ったまま、行列として一括処理できる。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:190004
#: ae53f4a2534b454dbde9426ccf24bfe0
msgid ""
"`filter` applies magnitude-only filtering, while `apply_response` can apply "
"arbitrary frequency responses including complex responses."
msgstr ""
"`filter` は magnitude-only のフィルタ適用、`apply_response` は複素応答を含む任意の周波数応答の適用に使える。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_frequencyseries.ipynb:190005
#: aaffdeafe3884ee3bb8aa92df51e98b0
msgid ""
"Using `ifft()`, you can convert back to the time-domain `TimeSeriesMatrix`, "
"enabling workflows where processing is done in the frequency domain and then"
" verified as waveforms."
msgstr ""
"`ifft()` により時間領域 `TimeSeriesMatrix` に戻せるので、周波数領域で処理してから波形として確認する流れが作れる。"
